Package: erhai-device
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Depends: erhai-device-support (>= 0.1.0~), erhai-display-power (>= 0.1.0~), erhai-firmware (>= 0.1.0~), erhai-audio (>= 0.1.0~), erhai-settings (>= 0.6.0~), erhai-kernel (>= 0.1.0~)
Description: OnePlus Pad 2 Pro (erhai) device metapackage
 Pulls in the whole device layer -- firmware, kernel and device support -- so
 that an otherwise untouched Ubuntu install becomes a running tablet, and
 removing this one package's dependencies takes the device layer back off.
 Compatible component updates may advance independently of this bundle.
 The kernel selector retains its exact versioned image/module dependency.
